breaking_changes.Adaptation_method:
Replace calls to uuid.parse() and uuid.unparse() with a dedicated UUID parsing library like uuid-parse (https://github.com/zefferus/uuid-parse). Example: 
```javascript
// Before
const buffer = uuid.parse('02a2ce90-1432-11e1-8558-0b488e4fc115');
const uuidString = uuid.unparse(buffer);

// After
const uuidParse = require('uuid-parse');
const buffer = uuidParse.parse('02a2ce90-1432-11e1-8558-0b488e4fc115');
const uuidString = uuidParse.unparse(buffer);
```
